Coding agents are my build partners. I still own the product decisions: the ads logic, the interface, the test flow, and the point where a feature works in code but still feels awkward to use. That mattered here. Generating a confident paragraph is easy. Producing a recommendation tied to a specific account, date range, KPI rule, and source is much harder. I started getting better results when I treated traceability as a user experience problem as well as a backend requirement.
